## Train/Test Split

::: {#b1657720 .cell execution_count=4}
``` {.python .cell-code}
X = bike.drop(columns=['bikers'])
y = bike['bikers']

X_train, X_test, y_train, y_test = train_test_split(
    X, y, test_size=0.3, random_state=4025)

print(f"Training: {X_train.shape[0]} obs  |  Test: {X_test.shape[0]} obs")
```

